# Battle stat-change arrow repro drive (vblank-indexed events).
# Path: title -> CONTINUE -> Cherrygrove -> Route 29 grass -> wild encounter
# -> select stat-move with DOWN then A.
#
# Input bits (DS): A=0x1, B=0x2, SELECT=0x4, START=0x8, RIGHT=0x10, LEFT=0x20,
# UP=0x40, DOWN=0x80, R=0x100, L=0x200. Written as bare names.
#
# Timing from the verified drive recipe (title 3000 START -> 3420 A menu ->
# 4840 A CONTINUE -> field ~7460):
3000 START
3420 A
4840 A
# field from ~7460: hold DOWN until walking south out of the lab area, then
# west (LEFT) toward Route 29 grass. Lengths are placeholders -- tune with
# captures after the first run.
7460-7700 DOWN
7700-8600 LEFT
8600-8700 UP
# encounter happens in grass; the battle menu: DOWN selects move 2
